==============================================================================
PASS -- the spectral form factor reproduces the real-space shell
sum at dz != 0, to better than 1e-3 relative once the shell has
converged.  So for every non-equal-depth plane the source-cell
average is now EXACT and needs no correction shell, no reach
parameter, and no box to enlarge.

REMAINING: dz = 0.  That is where the O(1/R) tail and the
shape-dependence live, and it is the Ewald branch, so it needs
an analytic tail rather than this multiplication.
